  "prefLabel": "Fis 311.01 Definitions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 311.01 Definitions.\n\n(a) “Big game animal” means a bear, deer, or moose.\n\n(b) “Licensed tracker” means a person licensed to use leashed dogs to track deer, moose, or bear in accordance with RSA 207:12-c.\n\nSource. #8839, eff 7-1-07; ss by#10619, eff 6-2-14; ss by #13970, eff 6-1-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/fis300.html"
